TEXT 232 192 Left 2 ;Test cases:\n \nFull reamanet flux\nNo remanent flux\nNo load\nSmall load\nce1=401n\nce1=400n\nrkessel=5e6 and 1e20\nr_x=0.005 and 0.03 of ohmic res. of petersen\n  (for swingin and max. voltage and sharpness\n   of resonant curve)\n   For steady state simulation of a petersen \n   see also peterson_unsymm.asc in the\n   loadflow examples folder\n \nSee transformer currents\nphase to phase/phase to earth voltages\npetersen voltage and current
